"rough rocky slope 1 south 1 down"
"The slope is nearly vertical, but very rough and probably covered in good

handholds.  It disappears into the mist shrouding the valley below, which is

surrounded by limestone cliffs on all sides.  The only signs of the valley

floor and a few treetops, boulders, and grassy knolls.

